{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"agent_message","text":"The deployed storefront is live and its public artwork URL is reachable from the outside. I also submitted one Prodigi sandbox smoke order with the exact apparel SKU/attributes and the deployed artwork endpoint; Prodigi accepted it as `Created` (sandbox orders are non-fulfilling/non-charging per their docs). I’m adding the Stripe webhook secret so fulfillment is covered even if a customer closes the success page early."}}
